# SentinelIQ — Build Plan (Updated 2026-08-11)

This plan reflects the **actual scanned state** of the repository. The core backend, RAG pipeline, persistence layer, and a basic frontend are already implemented and all 12 tests pass. The remaining work is focused on closing specific gaps to make the MVP complete and demoable end-to-end.

---

## 1. What's Already Built (verified)

- `config.py` — env-based settings (Postgres, Redis, Elastic, OpenAI, Pinecone, LLM)
- `main.py` — FastAPI app, CORS, 5 routers, `/health`, startup/shutdown hooks
- `ingestion/nvd_loader.py` — NVD REST API v2 fetch + normalize
- `ingestion/mitre_loader.py` — MITRE ATT&CK STIX fetch
- `ingestion/normaliser.py` — CVE and technique to document
- `scripts/ingest_now.py` — ingestion orchestration
- `scripts/init_db.py` — SQLAlchemy async models (CVERecord, AlertRecord), save/get helpers
- `rag/chunker.py`, `rag/embedder.py`, `rag/vectorstore.py` — chunk/embed/retrieve (in-memory, Pinecone, FAISS backends with offline deterministic fallback)
- `rag/llm.py`, `rag/prompts.py`, `rag/chain.py` — RAG answer chain + log correlation, with offline fallback
- `siem/correlator.py` — CVE extraction, similarity correlation, LLM report, alert persistence helper
- `api/schemas.py` — Pydantic models (Health, Query, Alert, Ingest)
- `api/routes/` — query, stream (SSE), ingest, dashboard, alerts
- `api/auth.py` — minimal token/hash helpers
- `frontend/` — React + Vite single-page dashboard (chat, alerts, timeline, CVE explorer, dark/light)
- `tests/` — 12 tests passing
- Dockerfiles, `docker-compose.yml`, `Makefile`, `README.md`

