## 4. Definition of Done

- `siem/client.py` exists and works with/without Elasticsearch
- `/alerts` returns real correlated alerts (DB or seeded samples)
- `POST /alerts/correlate` returns CVE correlations for a log event
- `/health` reflects real service states
- `POST /token` issues a token; protected routes reject missing/invalid tokens
- Frontend builds (`npm run build`) and proxies to backend in dev
- Chat streams answers via SSE
- All existing + new tests pass
- `docker-compose up` starts the full stack